Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:50:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] lsfg-vk step 2a: Vulkan device capabilities and shared
 LSFG layer (vulkan-hpp)

- Instance: request VK_KHR_vulkan_memory_model and VK_KHR_shader_float16_int8, and enable
  shaderStorageImage{Read,Write}WithoutFormat, only when built with HAS_LSFG.
  Adds IsLsfgCapable() (memory model + FP16 + nullDescriptor + write-without-format).
- renderer_vulkan/lsfg/lsfg_shaders: builds shader modules from the user's Lossless.dll.
- renderer_vulkan/lsfg/lsfg_common: LsfgImage / LsfgUniformBuffer (VMA, RAII, move-only),
  LsfgResources, LsfgBarriers, LsfgDescriptorWriter, LsfgPass, pool/sampler helpers.
  Resource creation throws vk::SystemError so FrameGen can disable itself instead of aborting.

NOT COMPILED: externals (vulkan-headers, VMA, boost, fmt) were empty in the source snapshot, so
this was only reviewed by hand and bracket-checked. Needs a first real build on-device/CI.
